our 37 mm guns. The 37 mm would later be replaced with the 40 mm Bofors gun M1.","LocalizedString":"The 37 mm gun M1 was an American anti aircraft autocannon that was used by the US Army during WWII. There were two variants of the 37 mm AA gun, a towed variant, and one where the gun was mounted with two M2 machine guns on the M2/M3 half-track. The gun was also deployed in coast defense anti-motor torpedo boat batteries, usually there were two 37 mm guns alongside 90 mm guns in the batteries, but some batteries had four 37 mm guns. The 37 mm would later be replaced with the 40 mm Bofors gun M1."},"operationCost":1,"rarity":"ERarityEnum::Uncommon","cardSet":"ECardSetEnum::Legions","isReserved":true,"showBoostIcon":true,"EffectType":"ECardEffectTypes::Trigger","extraHelpTextBubbleTypes":["EHelpBubbleTypes::Blitz","EHelpBubbleTypes::Trigger"],"hasBlitz":true,"soundEnterPlay":{"ObjectName":"SoundWave'Artillery_Move_FX'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/Assets/Audio/Units/Artillery_Move_FX.0"},"soundMoveToFrontline":{"ObjectName":"SoundWave'Artillery_Move_FX'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/Assets/Audio/Units/Artillery_Move_FX.0"},"soundAttack":{"ObjectName":"SoundWave'Silence'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/Assets/Audio/Silence/Silence.0"},"soundBlowUp":{"ObjectName":"SoundCue'AU_Exp_Armor_Medium_Cue'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/Assets/Audio/Card_Blowups/AU_Exp_Armor_Medium_Cue.0"},"soundProjectileImpact":{"ObjectName":"SoundWave'Silence'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/Assets/Audio/Silence/Silence.0"},"soundProjectileFiring":{"ObjectName":"SoundWave'Silence'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/Assets/Audio/Silence/Silence.0"},"Image":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/Images/USA/Invasion/t_us_light_aa_gun.t_us_light_aa_gun","SubPathString":""},"artist":"US WWII Poster","historyPhoto":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/HistoricalPhotos/37mm_M1_AA_GUN.37mm_M1_AA_GUN","SubPathString":""},"historyPhotoSize":{"X":512.0,"Y":366.0},"historyPhotoDescription":{"Namespace":"card_usa","Key